{"4108780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Da Vinci Cryptex 4", "steam_appid": 4108780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/bb232175fde46d5253b5057667eb2d8d.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/bb232175fde46d5253b5057667eb2d8d.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 4th chapter of the Italian inventor's puzzle series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the codes, unlock the Cryptex, and escape the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/337ea92a23219f5acf45726b0ed7532b.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/337ea92a23219f5acf45726b0ed7532b.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex 4</strong> is an escape room game with 50 unique riddles written on a book. The more you go on, the harder the puzzles become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/da8167d90e9742c191bf781c2585cf4e.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/da8167d90e9742c191bf781c2585cf4e.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 unique handcrafted puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Astonishing graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating background music</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of puzzles, math, brain teasers, mind games and IQ tests, <strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong> 4 is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/bb232175fde46d5253b5057667eb2d8d.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/bb232175fde46d5253b5057667eb2d8d.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 4th chapter of the Italian inventor's puzzle series!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the codes, unlock the Cryptex, and escape the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/337ea92a23219f5acf45726b0ed7532b.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/337ea92a23219f5acf45726b0ed7532b.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex 4</strong> is an escape room game with 50 unique riddles written on a book. The more you go on, the harder the puzzles become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/da8167d90e9742c191bf781c2585cf4e.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/da8167d90e9742c191bf781c2585cf4e.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 unique handcrafted puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Astonishing graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating background music</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of puzzles, math, brain teasers, mind games and IQ tests, <strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong> 4 is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785765185\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785765185 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Unravel 50 codes, unlock the Cryptex, and escape the room in this new chapter of The Da Vinci Cryptex series!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108780/9c37ce7ffc57641f41c9ae135f7e94d099448bc4/header.jpg?t=1785765185", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.ste